      <p>$$\\sigma_B^2 = (24,000 - 16,000)^2(0.1) + (20,000 - 16,000)^2(0.15) + (16,000 - 16,000)^2(0.5) + (12,000 - 16,000)^2(0.15) + (8,000 - 16,000)^2(0.1)$$[cite: 1]</p>
